      "content": "BOVINGDON             \tVENUS HILL TL 00 SW \t\t\t\t\t(South side)                                        6/46                                    \tStable at Mauldens -                                      \t\t(10m to NW of house) GV                                      \tII Stable. C17/early C18. Timber frame dark weatherboarded with steep old red tile roof. A long 4-bays stable facing E, enclosing the W side of the forecourt to Mauldens. Stable doors to yard. Included for group value. Listing NGR: TL0104101863"
